OL,3,GNEWSACoin hidden in 1971 earns finder
OL,4,Afree pint of beer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has claimed a free pint of beer
OL,7,Fafter finding a coin and a mysterious
OL,8,Fmessage hidden in the wall of her
OL,9,Fhouse.
OL,11,FThe card, discovered by Ellie Mead in
OL,12,FBicester, Oxfordshire, revealed the
OL,13,Fcache was left there in 1971 by
OL,14,Felectrician David Judd, who promised
OL,15,F"one pint best beer if penny returned".
OL,17,FA Facebook appeal traced his daughter,
OL,18,FHelen Russell, who revealed he was now
OL,19,Faged 92, living in Devon and happy to
OL,20,Fhonour the offer.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
